  "location": "DAA V5, 4.5(2)",
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "title": "DAA 4.5(2): annual recovery/wind-down audit is attached to item (n), which became 'conflicts of interests'",
      "summary": "DAA 4.5(2) requires an audit of \"the policies and procedures required by DAA 4.5.1(n)\". There is no rule 4.5.1; in 4.5(1) item (n) is now \"conflicts of interests\" and \"recovery and winddown\" is (o). In the version published as the initial version, (n) was \"recovery and winddown\". The letters changed in the consolidated version in force from 1 January 2025, and 4.5(2) was not updated. The subject of the audit (\"the amount required to achieve recovery and orderly winddown\") shows the intended item.",
      "correction": "Please read \"DAA 4.5(1)(o)\" for \"DAA 4.5.1(n)\" in 4.5(2) (an editorial correction under section 19(3)(a) of the AIFC Regulations on AIFC Acts)."
    }
  },
